{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>巨型風車、港式美食場景打卡＋聖誕老人合照</h2>\n<p>必到昂平市集圓形廣場同逾6米高嘅巨型紅白荷蘭風車打卡，仲有大人同小朋友都至愛嘅聖誕老人合照！當然唔少得懷舊茶餐廳同港式美食經典回憶，梗係要同巨型奶茶、菠蘿包同蛋撻selfie！\n</p>\n<h2>超吸睛蓋印活動＋免費示範＆大派奶茶</h2>\n<p>一邊打卡一邊玩儲印章遊戲，仲可以拎埋「港味」鍵盤鎖匙扣同限量版昂坪360 x黑白®奶茶杯返屋企！手快有，手慢冇！奶茶控絕對要睇資深奶茶師傳即場示範正宗港式沖製秘訣，兼即場嘆返杯免費即製奶茶！</p>\n<h2>黑白®主題纜車+港人限定半價來回纜車門票優惠</h2>\n<p>持香港身份證仲可以半價優惠搭來回纜車，一程水晶車廂、一程標準車廂，記得同限定黑白主題纜車打卡！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179370727034278247_6548692316ae9cd06b130b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179370727034278247_6548692316ae9cd06b130b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179370727210618775_21438507946ae9cd0852c9e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179370727210618775_21438507946ae9cd0852c9e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179370727380577511_11816275216ae9cd0a044de.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179370727380577511_11816275216ae9cd0a044de.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937072752613340_8649096456ae9cd0b80b4a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937072752613340_8649096456ae9cd0b80b4a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfRuXbwAcC4/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:22:54.695314+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":401,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T14:18:49.695053+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:18:43.372439+00:00","content_hash":"e0ca7aa2bd8c8aad74b1ba28d383c1cf9301b5a424dbe3e9dcf8f58461b1d206","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}